Dear Editor,\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\qj\partightenfactor0
\cf0 My coauthors Yilong Hou, Zhengpu Zhao, Yi Li and I are submitting our manuscript, "HAL-MLE Log-Splines Density Estimation (Part I: Univariate)," for consideration for publication in The Annals of Statistics.\
\
This paper studies nonparametric density estimation through the Highly Adaptive Lasso framework, establishing asymptotic linearity, pointwise asymptotic normality, and a uniform convergence rate for univariate HAL-MLE while clarifying its connection to classical total-variation-penalized methods.\
\
Thank you for your consideration.\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
